#import "/_lib/0.1.1.typ": *
#show: template

#taxon[Theorem]
#title[Groupoid Cardinality of Sigma-Types]

Let $A : "1-Type"$ be homotopy finite, let $B : A -> "1-Type"$ be a family of homotopy finite types. Then the total space of $B$ is 1-truncated, homotopy finite and
$
  |sum_(a : A) B(a)| = plus.big_(|a| : ||A||_0) (|B(a)|)/(|"Aut"_A (a)|).
$

#proof[
  #local("00ID")[TODO]: Using the #local("00FY")[Class Formula].
]
